msgctxt "92"
msgid "Kiryu-san, thanks for taking the time to meet up with us like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Yeah, we really appreciate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "This is Eiji. I think you met before, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Right. So what did you wanna talk to me about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Well, it's about the second club. We're wondering if you could talk to "
"Kazuki-san about it... Maybe help him see a different point of view?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Whether I'd be the manager of the new club or not, I really just wanna get "
"the Stardust name out there... That's all I've ever been after."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Kyogoku-san said he can get us a building, too, and his group is even "
"willing to provide us with any kind of staff we need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "I mean, it'd be huge! How can I pass up a chance like this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Did you talk to Kazuki about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"He wouldn't even listen to me. A second club is out of the question, as far "
"as he's concerned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Then I've got nothing to say to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"But I just know you can do it, Yuya-san! You've been the manager of "
"Kamurocho's hottest club forever now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "So... I think you'd be a great owner, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"I'd follow you there, bro! And I bet there's a lot of other hosts who'd love"
" to work in Yokohama if you were the boss, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Yuya, club affairs are your business, not mine. Kazuki must have his reasons"
" for saying no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "I guess you're right. I'll go have another talk with him myself."
msgstr ""

